WEBVTT

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.790
Neigh.

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:16.540
"PakaPaka Farms"
"Nothing but Alpacas"
Stage 3 is a dating sim nurturing simulation.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:19.580
<i>Throbbing Egg ~ Lady Murasaki</i>.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.790
My goodness. It's such a nice day
and you all look so grumpy.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.750
Akatsuki, wait! Don't move!

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.120
Oh, what we have here is a Pakamera.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.080
Pakamera?

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:36.500
They're robots inhabiting 13th Avenue
who film throughout the area...

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.000
...with the lenses in their eyes.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.120
While the city's main cameras are
stationary, these act as a supplement.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:47.790
Not only can they film outside, but their
ability to follow permits the viewers...

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:51.370
...to experience the stream
as if they were there.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:55.660
By the way, any facilities of
Genome Tower and the city itself...

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.790
...are completely yours to use as you please.

00:00:58.790 --> 00:00:59.870
However...

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.410
The tower's Floor 51
and above are forbidden.

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.000
Violators will be severely punished,
so do please take care.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:21.950
"The Ones Within"

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:46.290
I will now explain the rules.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.000
You will raise the girl born from this egg

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:54.580
as well as help her get along
with the school idol, Hikaru Genji.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:58.370
It's a nurturing game and a
dating sim mixed together then?

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:03.580
Incredible! It's like a dinosaur egg!

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:07.870
Lend me a drill, Mr. Alpaca!
I've got to see what's inside!

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:11.870
Please don't. The girl's ingredients
will come spilling out.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.410
The girl's ingredients?!

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:17.000
By the way, this stage requires
at least four Let's Players.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:21.000
There is no upper limit, so nominate
whoever you feel worthy.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.160
Please take some time to make your decision.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.450
Nurturing games are
up your alley, little bean.

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:27.080
"Soft-Spoken Let's Player: Himiko Inaba"
Nurturing games are
up your alley, little bean.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:29.660
"Soft-Spoken Let's Player: Himiko Inaba"

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:33.000
Did you nominate Beantsuki?

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.830
I did not.

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:36.700
Since this is part dating sim... Aikawa.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:38.580
"Of Few Words Let's Player: Makino Aikawa"
Since this is part dating sim... Aikawa.

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:39.950
"Of Few Words Let's Player: Makino Aikawa"

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:41.870
"Of Few Words Let's Player: Makino Aikawa"
I-Is he okay?

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:44.450
"Of Few Words Let's Player: Makino Aikawa"
You should at least keep your
eyes shut, Makimaki. They'll dry out.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.370
You should at least keep your
eyes shut, Makimaki. They'll dry out.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.750
If no one else cares,
I'd like to participate again.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.120
Didn't learn from last time, idiot?

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.950
Would you like to join, Anya?

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.410
Ain't gonna happen.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:58.750
I'll pass. There's no way
I'm doing two in a row.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.700
Given the genre, this one
shouldn't be scary though.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:05.290
Wh-What are you talking about?
The last one wasn't scary either!

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:09.200
Wh-What about Oshigiri? You seem
like you can handle girls well.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.910
H-Huh? No, I'm...

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:15.870
Zak here is incredibly bad
at dealing with girls!

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:18.410
I-I wouldn't say incredibly bad...

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:25.080
Pathetic! You're scared of 'em!

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.950
That's so cute of you!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.540
Is that an insult I hear, you bastard?!

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.330
You got a bone to pick with me?!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.370
Eh?! Forget your bone, I'm picking a fight!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.500
Are you an idiot?!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.580
It takes one to know one!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:46.250
Sorry, but I'm going to sit
this one out. Maybe next time.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.500
Where will you go?

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:51.080
Exploring.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:54.580
Kai sure operates at his own pace.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:57.120
Isn't that the way Paka went?

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.410
"Throbbing Egg User's Manual"

00:04:58.410 --> 00:04:59.580
"Throbbing Egg User's Manual"
The Throbbing Egg takes in
the breeder's preferences...

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.450
The Throbbing Egg takes in
the breeder's preferences...

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:04.080
...to determine the girl's
looks and personality.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:07.080
It will hatch about one hour after warming up.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:10.160
Warming up? So like this then?

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:15.000
Um, I don't think that heat will be enough.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:19.500
Even chicken eggs need to be
heated to 38 degrees Celsius.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.290
Why the hell does she
have to hatch from an egg?

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:24.250
The guy's got some sick hobbies.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:25.870
"Kitchenette"

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:29.330
Sensei! I found a heater!

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.450
Let's use that and the fireplace.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:35.700
Humidity is important, too,
so we'll place boiling water around it.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:38.250
And don't forget to roll it once in a while.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.160
What a pain in the ass.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:42.120
Let's just toss it in a bath.

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:43.290
Yeah.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.450
Huh?

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:47.080
Oh?

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.870
Soft-boiled egg.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.250
That's really the first thing you're gonna say?

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:56.200
--Zap.
--Just don't talk!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.120
Zap in the microwave.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:02.120
If we zap her, wouldn't
the pretty girl explode?

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:04.200
The whackos are multiplying...

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:05.080
Afro.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.870
Stop it!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:09.120
Character creation is no joke.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:12.330
If you screw with settings
and mess them up just for fun,

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:15.580
you'll end up regretting it
when there's a serious scene.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:16.830
O-Oh...

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:20.040
Starting naked or using
"AAAA" for a name is absurd.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.790
Nurturing games take devotion.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:24.660
If you don't pour time, money,
and love into it every day,

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.450
it'll hurt your completion percent.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:30.790
It's because of all the effort it takes
that makes completion oh so fulfilling.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:33.830
Girls, cows, veggies...
They're all my cute babies.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.790
Let's all do our best for
the babies... to the death.

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.950
Whoa...

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:44.000
Come on, everyone. Let's pray.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.160
Egg, oh egg. Please hatch soon.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.660
Fail and we'll make you
into eggs with crab and ham.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.500
Eh?

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:53.250
Savory egg custard and mayonnaise omelet...

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:56.540
<i>Oyakodon </i>carbonara and eggs with crab...

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.500
Eh?

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:00.290
Aren't eggs with crab just so tasty?

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:02.450
Pray for a healthy hatching!

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.660
Kudou, tell us what kind of girl you like!

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:10.700
Why should I?!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:14.290
The manual said it takes in
the breeder's preferences.

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:18.950
If you all say what kind of girl you like,
I'm sure she'll be a wonderful girl!

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.580
It'll be like a sleep over on a school trip!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.370
Oh no! Hurry up! The egg is cracking!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:27.080
Who cares about preferences?!

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.200
How about a girl... in a school uniform?!

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:33.120
I pray for an honest, kind, and healthy girl...

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:36.830
I wish... I could see Pandarou again...

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:38.540
Afro...

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:54.000
Th-This is...

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.120
Karirin!

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.160
Is that supposed to be me?

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.540
Please cut it out.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.700
Now, now. Would you like
to join me for something good?

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:08.410
I found a massive outdoor bath on Floor 30.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:10.370
An outdoor bath?

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:13.750
Yup! And it must be fate
that I found you here.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:16.910
I've been wanting to know you better.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:18.580
Right...

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:23.580
Plus... We need to talk about Akki...

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:27.790
The egg has broken... Yes...

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:31.250
And all of our thoughts
have indeed become one...

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.410
Wh-What is this?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.620
Papa... Mama... Nice to meet'cha.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.290
Me name's Lady Murasaki.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.950
Murasaki has an accent...

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.700
Akatsuki... Is the panda your doing?

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:54.660
Wh-When I thought about my preferences,
I might've goofed a little...

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.750
This is a lot worse than a little!

00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.080
How can we win over the school
idol with this clump of fur?!

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.160
Kudou, that's going too far!

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.410
She's charming and adorable!

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:07.790
You're looking at her with
a parent's eyes! Face reality!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:10.160
I am! In a girl-raising sim,

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.580
the uglier their face, the cuter they become!

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:16.950
By slowly raising their stats
or spending money if need be,

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:20.250
they'll develop a face everyone can adore!

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:23.580
I'm sure Murasaki can become
a wonderful lady, too.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:26.410
M-Mama, it's okay...

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:27.660
Hmm?

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:30.410
Someone like me is too big anyway...

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:33.660
Me so hairy, too... And me spots
aren't clearly black and white...

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:37.540
Nobody would ever wanna
love someone like me...

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:40.290
Your personality sucks!
And don't pull the afro!

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:44.120
That's not true at all!
Your mother loves you, Murasaki!

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:46.410
Your father loves you, too, Pandar--

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:50.790
Ahem! I just love how your black
and white spots mix together!

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.870
Can me really pull it off? Can me change?

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:56.750
You can! You can do it, Murasaki!

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.370
My head seriously hurts.
Would you say something, too?

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.790
Stare...

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:03.870
Huh?

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.450
Stare...

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.950
Huh?

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.160
Eh?

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:16.700
So you only met with Akki
after coming here, huh?

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:19.790
You two get along so well,
I thought for sure...

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:22.450
Please, that weird-hair wacko?

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:28.330
You know what? I'm what
they call a "complete" freak.

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:31.700
I've got to know everything about those I like.

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.540
I'm quite taken by you, too.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:40.120
E-Even if we're both girls,
isn't being this close a bit... w-weird?

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:44.500
Not once have I said anything
about being a girl.

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:56.790
N-No way... But you have some...

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:01.910
And have... none...

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:06.000
Sorry, sorry! I'm kidding!

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:12.370
Take a look. That little act
sure got the counter rolling.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:14.910
Th-They can see us here, too?

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:18.830
I'm not positive, but I think
that's a Pakamera there...

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:22.080
Nice aim!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:26.330
Th-That damn Alpaca!
I'm gonna skin him alive!

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:29.830
Well, the 100,000,000
view counter went way up.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:34.160
That means earning views isn't
limited to those playing the games.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:39.200
No matter what we do or where we go,
us eight are always Let's Playing.

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:45.830
Which is why you and I really ought
to get to know each other, Karin.

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:49.870
He loves me, he loves me not.
He loves me, he loves me not.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.450
He loves me...

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.660
Papa, me thinks me might be sick...

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:57.700
What?!

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:00.580
There's a pain in me heart
that won't go away...

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:01.790
Mother!

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:02.750
Yes?

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.120
Murasaki isn't feeling so well!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.870
Could it be a cold?

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:11.790
--Me chest! Me heart hurts so bad!

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:13.410
--Murasaki!
--Me chest! Me heart hurts so bad!

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:15.200
The vet! Get the vet!

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:17.500
I've got nothin' to say...

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:24.870
I see... Murasaki has a crush on Makino...

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:28.040
An annoying problem
got even more annoying.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.910
Anyway, let's get to school
first thing in the morning...

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:35.450
...and get this shitty game over with.

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:40.250
Shitty game? There's no such thing
as a shitty nurturing game.

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:41.950
Hey, put that away.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:43.950
Take it back right now.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:48.450
What you just said is an insult
to every baby born on this planet.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.250
I said put it away.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.790
Kudou! No matter what you say,
you're her father, too!

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:57.040
Hell no! I never gave birth to that furball!

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.750
Don't play dumb! This is child neglect!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:02.700
Your temper's too short!
Your eyebrows are too short!

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.330
My eyebrows got nothin' to do with this!

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:10.580
Hold on! If Anya is the father then
what does that make me? A third wheel?

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.200
You're just a regular idiot!

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:14.700
Not the hair!

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.080
Divine retribution.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:17.200
Huh?

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:23.910
Shit! What the hell's wrong
with that nurture freak?!

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:26.450
My poor eyes are throbbing...

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:29.000
I guess we're sleeping here tonight.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.500
Let's go to sleep, Anya.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.580
Ain't happening.

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.500
Out of medicine anyway.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:37.330
Medicine?

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.540
Forget it. But seriously...

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:42.290
Shut up, Makino!

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:46.290
"St. Shikibu Girl's Academy"

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.790
Whoa! Now that's a wild girl!

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:51.870
Me name's Murasaki. Nice to meet'cha.

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:53.790
Uh-huh! Aren't you a sweet girl?

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:55.000
Why are you here?

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:59.290
To cheer you on. Figured your girl
power was lacking for a dating sim.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:00.830
Sheesh.

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.200
Let's go.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:04.250
Huh?

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:07.370
"Protect"                             "Avenue"
This is the St. Shikibu Girl's Academy!

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:09.500
No one suspicious may enter.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:13.290
Eh? What's suspicious
about our girl?! I'll kill you!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.200
This is the St. Shikibu...

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:18.290
...Girl's Academy. Men are not permitted!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.580
--Gah! Lemme down, jerk! I'll kill you!

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:22.040
--Anya!
--Gah! Lemme down, jerk! I'll kill you!

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:22.870
--Anya!
--Let go, you jerk!

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:25.370
--G-Give him back!
--Let go, you jerk!

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:27.120
