Anya Kudou"
Give Anya back!

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.290
"Stage 3
Anya Kudou"
A-A-Anya!

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:33.120
"Eliminated"
A-A-Anya!

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:37.160
Mr. Genji! Eat mine!

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:39.250
--I sure will.
--Please eat mine, too!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:40.040
I will.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.700
"St. Shikibu Girl's Academy Teacher:
Hikaru Genji"
I made it during home ec!

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:43.410
"St. Shikibu Girl's Academy Teacher:
Hikaru Genji"
That's wonderful.

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:47.500
To think Mr. Genji was a teacher...
It's a forbidden love.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.700
At least we know he has
a stable job if he's a teacher.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.870
Well, Muramura? First
impressions of Mr. Genji?

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.200
H-He seems like a wonderful guy.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:59.160
All them girls around him were so cute...

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:02.540
Compared to them, me so... me so...

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.750
Y-You're incredibly cute, too, Murasaki!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:10.040
You need to tell the person
you like how you feel!

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:14.040
Let's think about what you can do
to make him happy together!

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:16.040
Mama...

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.580
Would you cut that out?

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.450
The person me likes...

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:22.750
To make him happy...

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:23.660
"Home Ec"

