A-Achoo!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:35.040
"Keep it tidy!"

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.370
Would you guys just...

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.620
...get out!

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:45.000
Let's go see what Mr. Genji is up to.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.500
Mmm.

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:53.120
It's tough being the idol of the school...

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.330
Damn those immature brats.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:58.120
Can't they give something
thoughtful for once?

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:02.330
Something befitting of the
gorgeous and beautiful me...

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:04.200
For example, yes...

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:07.080
Dom Perignon!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:11.250
--Yeah, nice shot, me! I'm the best!
The best! The best!

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:14.290
--Stare...
--Yeah, nice shot, me! I'm the best!
The best! The best!

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:17.370
I-I think we saw something amazing...

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:20.700
We've got to tell the others quick.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.910
Excuse me.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.330
A-Are you okay?

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:31.290
Uh, sorry! What can I do for you?

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:36.870
Um, me wanted to give you
something me made.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:41.200
Uh... Oh, how nice of you!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:43.540
Many thanks! I appreciate it!

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:48.410
Th-Then, me will excuse meself.

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:56.540
I'm mad! What the hell was that?!

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:59.160
It's maddening that she's
more stunning than me!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:02.000
It's unforgivable!

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:07.410
Because I... I have to shine
more than anyone else...

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:12.750
They'll say it to me again...
That I don't live up to my name...

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.120
What?

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:19.950
M-Me heard a loud voice, so...

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.870
Um, Mr. Genji is plenty--

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:25.790
You saw, right?

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:29.620
You saw that embarrassing side of me, right?

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:32.330
We can't have that...

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:35.580
Because I... am always sparkling.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:39.540
I'm the pretty Mr. Genji after all!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.200
Murasaki!

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:52.330
M-Makino!

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:56.910
Wh-What's your problem? I'm a teacher!

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:59.410
How dare you do that to me!

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:11.120
Oh! Are you a transfer student?

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:15.370
Forgive me! What's your class
and name? What's your birthd--

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:18.580
--Makino is awesome!

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:19.700
--Makimaki can bewitch people
with his eyes in just five seconds!
--Makino is awesome!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.950
--Makimaki can bewitch people
with his eyes in just five seconds!

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:24.620
Awesome! But scary!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:31.410
Um, don' do that. It's dirty
and all disfigured now...

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:35.910
--Makino is awesome!

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:38.330
--Perfect form, Makimaki!
--Makino is awesome!

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.290
"Science Room 2"

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:45.160
These are for y'all. Me wanted
everyone to have one.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.950
Me went and made these in secret.

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:52.410
Could you please give one of these
to me Papa with the scary face?

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:55.200
Anya... I wonder if he's doing all right?

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:59.080
Move it, punk! Where the hell am I?!

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:01.450
Why don't you just forget about him?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:05.620
B-But, me can't jus' leave him alone...

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.330
Me wants to tell him when he wakes up...

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:15.160
That to me, Hikaru Genji is the most
sparklin' teacher there's ever been.

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:19.790
Murasaki...

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:23.450
Then I'll punch him a few times in your place.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:28.330
I wonder why it feels like Mr. Genji
isn't going to wake for a while?

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:00.580
Me so blessed and happy...

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:02.250
Murasaki?

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:05.950
Me thinks it's time.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:09.950
Um...

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:15.620
Mama... Papa, too...

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:18.120
Uh, um...

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:25.080
Could you please hug me one last time?

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:49.500
"Science Room 2"

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:51.370
"Ingredients" "Panda Cookies" "Steps"

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.160
The hell's this?

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.910
Murasaki wanted you to have that.

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:30.540
Hey, where'd you two go?

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:34.000
In the end, we cleared Stage 3 in one piece.

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:39.120
Did something happen?

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:41.370
Um, well...

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:43.200
It's a long story.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.540
Good night.
